<%- include('../partials/header') %><main id="main-content" class="container-xl order-page"><%- include('nav') %><h1>确认软删除商品</h1><section class="order-card payment-card"><h2><%= product.name %></h2><p>编号：<%= product.sku %> · 当前库存 <%= product.stock %></p><p class="payment-notice">软删除后商品不再对顾客展示，原购物车会提示失效；已有订单明细仍然保留。请确认选择的是这件商品。</p><form action="/admin/products/<%= product.id %>/delete" method="post" class="payment-actions"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><input type="hidden" name="version" value="<%= product.version %>"><input type="hidden" name="confirmDelete" value="yes"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-brand">确认软删除</button><a class="btn btn-outline-brand" href="/admin/products">返回列表</a></form></section></main><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
